        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Avalanche Pummel"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Troff makes an icicle gouge Strike against a flat-footed creature. On a hit, the creature is dazzled. On a critical hit, the creature is blinded. Either way, the effect lasts until the start of Troff's next turn. If his Strike fails (but isn't a critical failure), Troff still deals 13 piercing damage to the creature."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
            "action_cost": {
              "value": "one_action"
            },
            "action_attack_bonus": {
              "value": 0
            },
            "action_damage_variants": {
              "value": []
            },
            "id": "4b9b82da-a81e-462b-8ad1-1dafbb670d80",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-19T22:58:59.453743"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Chattering Blow"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(cold, press)\n\nRequirements: Troff is within reach of a creature that has taken cold damage since the end of Troff's last turn\n\nTroff jabs a pressure point on the creature made vulnerable by cold. The creature must attempt a 31 Fortitude save as its skin freezes and its limbs turn sluggish and clammy.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The creature takes 2d4 persistent cold damage and a \u20135-foot status penalty to its Speeds until the persistent cold damage ends. Dealing fire damage to the creature is an especially effective way to help end the persistent cold damage (allowing a new flat check to end it at 10).\n- **Failure:** As success, but the damage is 4d4 and the penalty is \u201315-foot.\n- **Critical Failure:** As success, but the damage is 6d4 and the creature is immobilized instead of taking a Speed penalty."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
            "action_cost": {
              "value": "one_action"
            },
            "action_attack_bonus": {
              "value": 0
            },
            "action_damage_variants": {
              "value": []
            },
            "id": "7c70f7c2-c9b0-4978-b9df-d981038352f9",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-19T22:58:59.453743"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Flurry of Blows"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(flourish)\n\nTroff makes two Strikes with his fist. If both hit the same creature, combine their damage to overcome resistances and weaknesses."
            },
